      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Common Investigation Flow\n1. **Job not starting:** Check S3 file, SQS queue depth/oldest age, ECS service health, and startup errors.\n2. **Record count mismatch:** Download ZIP, compare `.properties` expected counts to CSV actual counts.\n3. **Volume exceeded:** Job becomes STOPPED, not FAILED. Validate source volume, then restart from Compass UI if acceptable.\n4. **Unknown organizations:** Check `CHANGED='S'`, ABA format, and whether organization exists in Compass.\n5. **Long running job:** Check step durations, database performance, slow queries, and input volume.\n6. **DLQ > 0:** Critical. Message is stuck and job is not processing normally.\n\n**DataLite Store Jobs:** `dasyRevenueStoreJob`, `ftaStoreJob`, `vpnStoreJob`, `fedMailStoreJob`, `nicBhcStoreJob`, `pieUserStoreJob`, `routerStoreJob`, `udyStoreJob`, `uimStoreJob`"
      }
